the order things run in

@BeforeAll        once, before everything.  static.
  @BeforeEach     before each test
    @Test         one test
  @AfterEach      after each test
  @BeforeEach
    @Test
  @AfterEach
@AfterAll         once, after everything.  static.

BeforeEach runs again for every test, on a new instance

